<title>USA: Republic raises $530 mln in stk placement.</title>
<headline>Republic raises $530 mln in stk placement.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc said Monday it has raised about $530 million in a private placement in which it sold about 15 million shares at $35.50 each.</p>
<p>The placement is to be completed Tuesday. Closing was delayed by a day because of the banking holiday today, it said.</p>
<p>Proceeds are to be used for general corporate purposes, Republic said.</p>
<p>Republic is a diversified services group led by Florida billionaire Wayne Huizenga.</p>
